@anon.a6b6a9a55df1a6fb8afb47e1f078e4b4.917 = private unnamed_addr constant [346 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for the presence of docstrings in stub files.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AStub files should omit docstrings, as they're intended to provide type\0Ahints, rather than documentation.\0A\0A## Example\0A\0A```pyi\0Adef func(param: int) -> str:\0A    \22\22\22This is a docstring.\22\22\22\0A    ...\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A\0A```pyi\0Adef func(param: int) -> str: ...\0A```\0A", align 1
